    title: "Insurance Agent Leads: A Foundational Product Guide",
    metaTitle: "Insurance Agent Leads Guide",
    excerpt: "A foundational guide to the lead products available to insurance agents across product lines.",
    metaDescription: "A foundational guide to the lead products available to insurance agents across product lines, from exclusive leads to shared and aggregator leads.",
